<chapter xml:id="ch-algebra-equations" xmlns:xi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XInclude">
  <title>Equations</title>

  <introduction>
    <p>
      An equation states that two expressions are equal. Solving an equation means finding the value(s) of the unknown that make the equation true.
      This chapter covers linear equations, simultaneous equations, and quadratic equations.
    </p>
  </introduction>

